WEBVTT

00:00:05.029 --> 00:00:07.075
- Kevin would leave the cave--
- [ Gasps ]

00:00:07.118 --> 00:00:09.860
go back to the outside world,
and he would not return...

00:00:09.904 --> 00:00:12.776
until he had found his tribe
the biggest, baddest villain
to serve.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.169
[ Minionese ]

00:00:14.212 --> 00:00:16.258
But he needed help.

00:00:16.301 --> 00:00:18.565
Me! Me. Hey, hey!
[ Minionese ]

00:00:18.608 --> 00:00:20.784
Bob was eager to go.

00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:24.484
But Kevin felt
he was just not strong enough
for the dangerous journey ahead.

00:00:24.527 --> 00:00:26.964
Uh, no. Um--
[ Minionese ]

00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:29.053
[ Mumbling ][ Minionese ]

00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:31.142
[ Grunts ]

00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:33.231
[ Minionese ]

00:00:33.275 --> 00:00:34.842
[ Stammers ]
Ooh!

00:00:34.885 --> 00:00:36.626
Luckily, someone stepped up.Huh? Eh?

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.323
Stuart--
[ Minionese ]

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.978
Huh? Me? Me?
Oh, thank you.

00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:43.764
Truth be told, Stuart had
no idea what he was chosen for--Thank you! Thank you!

00:00:43.807 --> 00:00:46.723
Huh?
[ Minionese ]

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:49.552
but was thrilled
it made people cheer for him.

00:00:49.596 --> 00:00:52.555
Thank you--
[ Minionese ]

00:00:52.599 --> 00:00:54.514
♪♪ [ Minionese ]Uh, Stuart, Stuart--

00:00:54.557 --> 00:00:56.080
[ Minionese ]

00:00:56.124 --> 00:00:58.996
Me! Aah!
[ Minionese ]

00:01:02.565 --> 00:01:04.567
See?[ Flatulence ]

00:01:04.611 --> 00:01:05.829
Ooh!

00:01:05.873 --> 00:01:07.657
Uh, okay?

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:09.964
[ Minionese ][ Bob Grunting ]

00:01:10.007 --> 00:01:12.749
[ Mumbling In Minionese ]

00:01:12.793 --> 00:01:14.925
[ Sighs, Minionese ]

00:01:14.969 --> 00:01:16.623
[ Gasps ]
Yeah!

00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:19.016
Eventually,
Bob's energy and enthusiasm,

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.062
but mostly
lack of other volunteers,

00:01:21.105 --> 00:01:22.585
changed Kevin's mind.

00:01:22.629 --> 00:01:24.369
[ Minionese ]

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.154
Kumbaya!Kumbaya!

00:01:26.197 --> 00:01:27.764
Kumbaya!

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:31.638
The tribe said their farewells.[ Minions Cheering ]

00:01:31.681 --> 00:01:34.989
Kevin had given them something
they hadn't had
in a very long time--

00:01:35.032 --> 00:01:36.947
Hope.Kevin!

00:01:36.991 --> 00:01:38.645
Bob![ Chuckling ]

00:01:38.688 --> 00:01:40.864
Hey, Tony.
[ Minionese ]

00:01:40.908 --> 00:01:42.649
Tom--

00:01:42.692 --> 00:01:46.087
Hey, Chris--

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.785
[ Kevin ] Hey, Bob--
[ Speaking Minionese ]Ah. Sí, sí.

00:01:50.221 --> 00:01:52.441
[ Minions Chanting ]

00:01:52.484 --> 00:01:54.617
Bye-bye.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.233
[ Narrator ]
Kevin felt pride.

00:02:02.277 --> 00:02:05.715
He was going to be the one
to save his tribe.

00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.456
Stuart felt--[ Stomach Grumbling ]

00:02:07.499 --> 00:02:08.979
