00:02:09.023 --> 00:02:11.329
He was going to be the one
to eat this banana.

00:02:12.461 --> 00:02:14.332
Oh. And Bob--

00:02:14.376 --> 00:02:16.465
- [ Gasps ]
- [ Eagle Screeching ]

00:02:16.508 --> 00:02:19.729
Bob was frightened
of the journey ahead.

00:02:19.773 --> 00:02:21.383
[ Whimpering ]

00:02:21.426 --> 00:02:23.907
Ah. Okay.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:26.693 --> 00:02:28.564
[ Sighs ]

00:02:28.608 --> 00:02:30.653
Uh--
[ Sniffles ]

00:02:30.697 --> 00:02:33.613
Okay. Okay.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:33.656 --> 00:02:35.136
[ Minionese ]

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:37.878
And they were off--

00:02:37.921 --> 00:02:41.272
off to find their new boss!

00:02:43.797 --> 00:02:45.799
[ Kevin Shouting ][ Bob Grunting ]

00:02:45.842 --> 00:02:49.063
[ Groans ]

00:02:49.106 --> 00:02:51.543
[ Snoring ]

00:02:56.157 --> 00:02:58.986
[ Murmuring ]

00:02:59.029 --> 00:03:01.553
[ Panting ]

00:03:01.597 --> 00:03:04.208
Oh! Kevin!
[ Panting ]

00:03:07.124 --> 00:03:08.604
[ Exhales ]

00:03:13.522 --> 00:03:17.831
[ Stuart Straining ]

00:03:21.661 --> 00:03:23.271
[ Groaning ]Eh?

00:03:23.314 --> 00:03:24.707
[ Stomach Grumbling ][ Whimpering ]

00:03:24.751 --> 00:03:26.883
[ Minionese ]

00:03:26.927 --> 00:03:29.233
[ Minionese ]

00:03:29.277 --> 00:03:30.670
[ Gasps ]
Banana?

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:34.674
Uh, Stuart--
[ Minionese ]

00:03:34.717 --> 00:03:36.414
Banana.
[ Stammers ]

00:03:36.458 --> 00:03:38.025
- Banana!
- [ Both Screaming ]

00:03:38.068 --> 00:03:40.636
[ Groaning ]
Stuart--

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.029
[ Minionese ]

00:03:44.771 --> 00:03:46.729
Uh, Bob?
[ Minionese ]

00:03:46.773 --> 00:03:49.558
[ Boat Horn Blaring ]

00:03:51.865 --> 00:03:53.083
[ Gasps ]

00:03:53.127 --> 00:03:55.695
♪♪ [ Rock ]

00:03:56.565 --> 00:03:59.002
Huh?
[ Gasps, Cheers ]

00:03:59.046 --> 00:04:00.656
Hey, Bob![ Panting ]

00:04:01.918 --> 00:04:04.442
[ Speaking Minionese ]

00:04:07.445 --> 00:04:09.012
[ Exhales Sharply ]

00:04:09.056 --> 00:04:11.145
[ Minionese ] Sí, sí.

00:04:11.188 --> 00:04:13.843
[ Minionese ]

00:04:13.887 --> 00:04:15.845
[ Man ]
♪ And though you've tried,
you just can't hide ♪

00:04:15.889 --> 00:04:18.892
♪ Your eyes
are edged with tears ♪[ Grunts ]

00:04:18.935 --> 00:04:20.763
♪ You better stop [ Minionese ]

00:04:20.807 --> 00:04:22.199
Uh, no, no.
[ Minionese ]No, no, no, no.

00:04:22.243 --> 00:04:24.201
[ Grunts, Minionese ]

00:04:24.245 --> 00:04:26.116
[ Mumbling ]

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.639
[ Stifled Chuckling ]No, no, no.

00:04:27.683 --> 00:04:29.206
