nervous breakdown ♪

00:04:37.824 --> 00:04:40.130
Whoo-hoo-hoo![ Chuckling ]

00:04:40.174 --> 00:04:42.567
Oh, look at that one!Whoa!

00:04:42.611 --> 00:04:45.179
Huh-- Oh! Look at that one!Wow!

00:04:45.222 --> 00:04:47.224
Peace!Make love, not war!

00:04:47.268 --> 00:04:49.705
- Peace on Earth!
- Boo-ya! Boo-ya! Boo-ya!

00:04:49.749 --> 00:04:52.186
Hey, hey, hey. Oh.
[ Minionese ]

00:04:52.229 --> 00:04:54.405
Boo-ya!
Boo-ya. Boo-ya.

00:04:55.711 --> 00:04:57.147
[ Gasps ]
Oh, oh, oh.

00:04:57.191 --> 00:04:58.845
Wow.

00:04:58.888 --> 00:05:00.368
