00:05:00.411 --> 00:05:02.457
Banana.
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.198
Hey, taxi!Hey, hey, hey!

00:05:04.241 --> 00:05:05.503
Oh.

00:05:05.547 --> 00:05:07.679
♪ Here it comes

00:05:07.723 --> 00:05:10.204
♪ Here it comes

00:05:10.247 --> 00:05:11.771
Oh, oh, oh!

00:05:11.814 --> 00:05:13.555
[ Murmuring ]

00:05:13.598 --> 00:05:16.863
Hey! Banana!
Hey, hey, hey-- Oh!

00:05:16.906 --> 00:05:18.952
